== parse_url
proto: https://
user: johndoe
pass: abc123
host: example.com
port: 8443
path: a/b.html

 Use second argument to return just 1 variable.
 parse_url() demo: 

   proto: ftp://
   user:  
   pass:  
   host:  example.org
   port:  
   path:  pub


 Use second argument to return just 1 variable.
 parse_url() demo: 

   proto: http://
   user:  
   pass:  
   host:  example.com
   port:  8080
   path:  index.html

